 lines+=['', 'POST_SEAL_DIAGNOSTICS retains both-round actual per-edge candidate quality, reward/posterior good-vs-harmful rankings relative GT E quality, teacher-minus-prior good mass, candidate headroom and complete-box reward after mean composition. Candidate shared base equalsE only in first round or Fixed; Live second shared base is the current student, so ranking fields explicitly say shared_base. Missing visual supports are counted separately, not assigned artificial ranking success/failure. Every query remains in primary metrics.','', 'Complete composed-box scoring is postseal diagnostic only,2 extra ROI evaluations per node/branch (both intermediate/final mean boxes), never used for step acceptance, rollback, sampling or deployment. Live second shared-zero already reads its first composed full box. No mean ROI score gate. Extra diagnostics are separately accounted, not hidden inside the17rollout budget.','', '## Actual response and edge interaction\n\nEdge Live changed size at393 HC/372 Vid actual nodes, with0illegal training samples. Complete composed-box reward improved29/30 supported HC query-steps and22/22Vid, mean+.004279/+.005214 in raw reward units, not IoU pp. Thus absent size connection or universal composition-destroyed feedback is not supported as an explanation. Scoring better does not imply better localization.\n\nHC Edge−Center leave-one-out mean full-v stays negative[-.056585,-.019799]pp and actual-s[-.083612,-.012001], while original paired intervals cross0; no single-case explanation or confirmed universal decline. Vid has positive matching intervals and positive leave-one-out means; preserve that domain result without domain-specific method switching. HC NH007 Edge−E complete-v−.283269pp/actual-s−.748953pp remains; worst HC complete-v vsCenter NH016−.287248pp.\n\nInitial per-edge pool best GT gain vsE2.564/3.303pp, second actual Live pool2.994/3.630; not an official full-tube oracle. Initial E-beneficial candidates above shared-base posterior20.42%/10.57%; strong pools no beneficial candidate outranks shared-base66.43%/84.15%. Second-round GT gains remain E-relative while shared-base score comparison uses current box. No assertion that AUC increase across different pools proves Live over Fixed.\n\n','## Verification and costs','', 'Independent root NumPy audit reconstructs stratified noise using NormalDist rather than SciPy ndtri, bounded physical candidates, fine ROI bilinear rewards, four separate conditional probabilities/gradients, every actual mean/state/output, exact Center reuse/scope/planned/time, official metrics and parent bootstrap. GPT-6.1 Sol/max separately reviews source/history and sealed evidence.','', 'Pre-first-measurement correction preserved original core/runner/protocol/runtime: nonfinite proposals fail before ROI, finite mean guard, evaluation slots not falsely called globally unique across rounds. No noise/configuration/teacher/GT rule change. Postseal explanatory-analysis-only recovery preserved original script/failure: empty5candidate visual support caused a generic max-over-empty error; now report missing support and geometric headroom separately. No prediction, main metric, denominator or decision changed.','',str(cost),'', 'No new trials, anchor mixture or stronger optimizer launched based on this result. No production promotion.','', '## Every signed complete-v change vs E, pp','','| Alias | Target | Center | Edge Fixed | Edge Live | Edge Shuffle |','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
